      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Rolling Sixes - explosions\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,1539,1566]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-rolling-sixes-explosions:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "When you roll a natural 6 on an\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,1566,1598]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-rolling-sixes-explosions:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Attack die (ignore any modifiers: if\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,1598,1635]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-rolling-sixes-explosions:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the die shows a 6, that’s a natural\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,1635,1671]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-rolling-sixes-explosions:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "6), roll another d6 and add it to the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,1671,1709]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-rolling-sixes-explosions:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "total. If you roll another natural 6,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,1709,1747]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-rolling-sixes-explosions:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "add another d6, and so on. You\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,1747,1778]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-rolling-sixes-explosions:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "could roll ANY number on a die if\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,1778,1812]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-rolling-sixes-explosions:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you are lucky enough. This is called\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,1812,1849]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-rolling-sixes-explosions:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“exploding dice roll” or simply\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,1849,1881]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-rolling-sixes-explosions:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“explosion”.",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,1881,1893]]"
    }
  ],
